			"uuid": "7c2c027f-04e3-4bd8-acf2-5241cc2da261",
			"title": "Implement game launching",
			"description": "Connect the Play button to your existing framework. The manager should create a session, initialize the selected game, and display it.\nDeliverable: you can launch your test game and return to the browser afterward.",
			"category": "9295a900-9731-4fe2-ab12-14a46d99b5ee",
